  p1:['Let\'s talk about what you do. Do you work, or are you a student?','What do you enjoy most about your work or studies?','Is there anything you would like to change about it?','Now let\'s talk about weekends. What did you do last weekend?','Do you prefer busy weekends or relaxing ones? Why?','Are weekends in your country different from how they were in the past?','Let\'s move on to photographs. Do you like taking photos?','What kind of photos do you keep on your phone?','Do you prefer looking at photos on a screen or printed photos?'],
